{
  "info": {
    "name": "Kriraghor API: M19 Dashboards",
    "description": "v3 money on a ৳2,000/h ground with a 25% advance. A member books and pays the ৳500 advance; it is played (checked in) today, earning the owner ৳2,000 gross. A second booking is cancelled by the member, earning the kept ৳500. The facts are written from the real events; the views refresh; the owner, member and platform dashboards show the numbers, the charts add up to their tiles, and the ledger fee revenue is ৳125 (৳100 + ৳25). A deleted fact comes back with the nightly reconcile. CSV exports are scoped and audited.\n\nRequests named \"Runner\" go to the local test runner (paying through the simulator, moving a booking in time, settling events and views, the reconcile).\n\nUnattended: `node postman/run-m19.js` (kriraghor_test database).\n\nRebuild this file with: node postman/build-collection-m19.js",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
